---
// Standard On-CPU profiling vs fgprof On-CPU + Off-CPU wait visibility + alloc_space vs inuse_space.
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="ge7c">
  <div class="ge7c-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparing standard CPU profiling which misses Off-CPU waits like disk reads, mutex contention, and network calls against fgprof full goroutine profiling, plus Heap alloc_space versus inuse_space.">
      {/* Top: Timeline On-CPU vs Off-CPU */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="872" height="140" rx="10" class="ge7c-card" />
      <text x="30" y="40" class="ge7c-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Why standard Go CPU profiles miss 50% of latency: On-CPU vs. Off-CPU (fgprof)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Tại sao CPU profile chuẩn bỏ sót 50% độ trễ: On-CPU vs. Off-CPU (fgprof)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Request wall-clock bar: 100 ms total */}
      <text x="30" y="68" class="ge7c-b">Wall time (100ms):</text>
      <rect x="160" y="52" width="140" height="24" rx="4" class="ge7c-oncpu" />
      <text x="172" y="68" class="ge7c-b-ok">CPU 15 ms</text>
      <rect x="304" y="52" width="420" height="24" rx="4" class="ge7c-offcpu" />
      <text x="318" y="68" class="ge7c-b-red">Blocked on Mutex / Disk / SQL I/O (70 ms — Off-CPU!)</text>
      <rect x="728" y="52" width="140" height="24" rx="4" class="ge7c-oncpu" />
      <text x="740" y="68" class="ge7c-b-ok">CPU 15 ms</text>

      <rect x="30" y="92" width="416" height="48" rx="6" class="ge7c-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="112" class="ge7c-b-red">Standard CPU pprof sees ONLY 30 ms on cores:</text>
      <text x="44" y="130" class="ge7c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Reports CPU work as 100%; blind to the 70 ms I/O wait!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ đo lúc goroutine chạy CPU → bỏ sót 70 ms đứng chờ!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="462" y="92" width="406" height="48" rx="6" class="ge7c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="476" y="112" class="ge7c-b-ok">fgprof captures On-CPU + Off-CPU (~99 Hz):</text>
      <text x="476" y="130" class="ge7c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Exposes mutex stalls, disk Reads, and API waits at once.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Quét cả lúc ngủ chờ → lòi ngay chỗ kẹt I/O hay Mutex!</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Bottom: Heap Sample Types Matrix */}
      <rect x="14" y="168" width="426" height="108" rx="10" class="ge7c-card" />
      <text x="30" y="194" class="ge7c-b">alloc_space / alloc_objects (Cumulative churn)</text>
      <text x="30" y="216" class="ge7c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Counts EVERY byte allocated since process start, even if freed by GC.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đếm TẤT CẢ byte từng cấp phát từ lúc bật app (kể cả đã dọn).</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="30" y="236" class="ge7c-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Use to hunt: short-lived garbage creating high GC CPU latency.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng để bắt: hàm sinh nhiều rác ngắn hạn làm GC tốn CPU.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="30" y="256" class="ge7c-m">(Note: default runtime.MemProfileRate samples 1 alloc per 512 KB)</text>

      <rect x="458" y="168" width="428" height="108" rx="10" class="ge7c-card is-red" />
      <text x="474" y="194" class="ge7c-b-red">inuse_space / inuse_objects (Live snapshot)</text>
      <text x="474" y="216" class="ge7c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Shows ONLY objects currently alive on heap at capture time.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ giữ các object CÒN SỐNG trên heap ngay tại thời điểm chụp.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="474" y="236" class="ge7c-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Use to hunt: growing memory leaks, caches, or OOM buildup.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng để bắt: lỗi rò RAM (memory leak) làm heap phình tới OOM.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="474" y="256" class="ge7c-m">(Pair with goroutine profile to spot leaked channel waiters)</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Choosing the wrong profile blinds root-cause analysis: use fgprof when I/O or locks dominate wall time, alloc_space when garbage creation slows CPU, and inuse_space when live RAM keeps climbing.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chọn sai loại profile rất dễ đi nhầm hướng: dùng fgprof khi app chậm vì chờ I/O hay Mutex, dùng alloc_space để giảm rác cho GC, và dùng inuse_space để săn lỗi rò RAM làm phình bộ nhớ sống.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge7c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge7c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge7c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge7c text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge7c-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge7c-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .ge7c-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge7c-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .ge7c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7c-oncpu { fill: rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.14); stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7c-oncpu { fill: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.14); stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7c-offcpu { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .ge7c-h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge7c-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge7c-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge7c-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7c-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7c-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge7c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
